    "summary": "Costs 1 CP. React immediately when an **ADEPTA SORORITAS** unit of yours suffers a mortal wound. Pick it or a unit of yours up to 3\" away with **ADEPTA SORORITAS JUMP PACK**. The chosen unit’s models get Feel No Pain 5+ against [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds) through phase end. If your pick is **ADEPTA SORORITAS JUMP PACK**, the same protection covers models in your friendly **ADEPTA SORORITAS** units while those units are up to 3\" from it.",
